  "method": "WindowServer own-window compositing via deprecated public CGWindowListCreateImage symbol compatibility bridge. Harness guards the target belongs to NSApp and requests only its exact own CGWindowID. No whole-screen capture, permission request or VNC authentication. Original production AppKit renderers, native window chrome and glass hosts.",
